From 40ca6e73322e063f343081eeaf5dd0aa9b8e2ed8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Damiano Lampisti <35961105+damianolampisti00@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:10:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Add BlackBerry 10 framebuffer & input (libscreen + BPS)

- ffi/bb10_h: libscreen, BPS (navigator, battery) & keycodes cdecls (ffi-cdecl).
- ffi/bb10: shared libscreen window + BPS init, battery, navigator_invoke.
- ffi/framebuffer_bb10: RGB32 shadow buffer copied to the window, like Android.
- ffi/input_bb10: BPS events to evdev-style events (touch, keys, navigator).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
